WEBVTT

00:02:29.437 --> 00:02:33.316
Their stories are mostly
unseen and unheard.

00:02:34.483 --> 00:02:38.821
But it's important to see these stories
and not look away.

00:02:39.906 --> 00:02:42.116
Photographs inspire compassion

00:02:42.116 --> 00:02:45.244
and enhance our understanding
of the world.

00:02:45.286 --> 00:02:49.123
It is a powerful tool
for making connections with people.

00:02:49.624 --> 00:02:53.586
But when we undertake the task
of sharing people's lives,

00:02:53.586 --> 00:02:55.838
we have an added responsibility.

00:02:56.255 --> 00:03:00.259
Are we representing them
with dignity and fairness?